## Missing Runtime Bindings

| Runtime Binding | Finding | Product Impact |
|---|---|---|
| Real provider invocation | C09 contracts are non-executing metadata | No live action can complete through provider path |
| Provider registry DB management | Provider registry is static code | Operators cannot configure providers as product data |
| Adapter registry DB management | Adapter registry is static code | Operators cannot onboard adapters from UI/data layer |
| Execution request persistence | No first-class execution request/plan table found | Accepted requests are not product-traceable as durable objects |
| Frontend proxy action binding | POST module-adapter action request is not allowlisted | Browser UI cannot call the backend action route |
| C15 callback product flow | Callback/DLQ APIs exist without UI | Recovery and replay are engineering-only |
| Live operations product flow | Live gate writes exist without UI | Gate operation remains backend/control-plane only |
| API key stack | No model/API/UI found | API key management is not implemented |

